WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.203 --> 00:00:10.205
&gt;&gt;&gt; I want you to take a look at

00:00:10.305 --> 00:00:10.538
this.

00:00:10.672 --> 00:00:12.907
The U.S. Navy release new images

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:14.709
of the Chinese spy balloon they

00:00:14.843 --> 00:00:18.713
recovered in the waters off of

00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:21.449
South Carolina.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:24.719
This is really intriguing to

00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:26.221
see, Chinese balloon shot down

00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:26.621
over the weekend.

00:00:26.755 --> 00:00:33.428
&gt;&gt; Right now, the house

00:00:33.561 --> 00:00:35.530
committee is holding a hearing

00:00:35.663 --> 00:00:38.233
to look at the failures of the

00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:41.069
government not detecting Chinese

00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:44.539
incursions in the trump

00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:45.006
administration.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.675
What are you learning, Oren

00:00:47.809 --> 00:00:48.243
Liebermann?

00:00:48.243 --> 00:00:49.744
&gt;&gt; I was watching house

00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:51.479
committee, and although it was

00:00:51.613 --> 00:00:53.615
scheduled before the latest

00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:55.049
Chinese government has been

00:00:55.183 --> 00:00:56.785
discovered, it has been a topic

00:00:56.918 --> 00:00:59.120
of the committee, and the

00:00:59.254 --> 00:01:00.255
chairman said that you would

00:01:00.255 --> 00:01:01.723
have to be naive to know that it

00:01:01.856 --> 00:01:04.259
was not an attempt by China to

00:01:04.325 --> 00:01:05.493
spy on the United States.

00:01:05.627 --> 00:01:08.763
Last year, there was a report

00:01:08.897 --> 00:01:12.300
called the people's republic of

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:14.702
China high altitude means.

00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:17.472
It documents case in 2019 where

00:01:17.605 --> 00:01:19.407
a balloon flew all around the

00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:24.279
world over Hawaii and over

00:01:24.379 --> 00:01:24.979
flying parts of southern Florida

00:01:25.113 --> 00:01:26.414
in the trump administration, and

00:01:26.548 --> 00:01:28.283
what is unclear in this report

00:01:28.283 --> 00:01:30.718
is when the U.S. Realized it was

00:01:30.852 --> 00:01:32.454
a Chinese surveillance balloon,

00:01:32.587 --> 00:01:34.289
and the Pentagon believed that

00:01:34.289 --> 00:01:35.857
is the intent of the balloon,

00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:37.425
and this is another point that

00:01:37.559 --> 00:01:41.162
the Pentagon said yesterday,

00:01:41.296 --> 00:01:45.433
general Glenn vanerk said that

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.837
there was an awareness gap that

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.338
allowed China to fly balloons

00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:53.374
three times over the U.S. In the

00:01:53.508 --> 00:01:54.576
trump administration without

00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:56.644
them knowing it, and it was only

00:01:56.778 --> 00:01:57.946
later that the U.S. Went back to

00:01:58.313 --> 00:01:59.848
look at the data and the

00:01:59.981 --> 00:02:01.216
trajectories of these balloons

00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:03.351
that they came to believe they

00:02:03.485 --> 00:02:04.752
were surveillance balloon, and

00:02:04.886 --> 00:02:06.321
the gap is what the U.S. Is

00:02:06.321 --> 00:02:07.355
trying the close now especially

00:02:07.489 --> 00:02:09.324
now that it has the balloon in

00:02:09.457 --> 00:02:11.059
hand or parts of it as we see

00:02:11.192 --> 00:02:14.395
with the images, and working to

00:02:14.529 --> 00:02:15.897
recover the rest of it, Kate.

00:02:16.331 --> 00:02:17.198
&gt;&gt; Oren, thank you so much.

00:02:17.332 --> 00:02:18.733
&gt;&gt;&gt; The FBI lab as we have been

00:02:18.867 --> 00:02:22.704
seeing the images and what is

00:02:22.837 --> 00:02:26.941
being recovered, the FBI is

00:02:27.075 --> 00:02:28.343
identifying the parts of the

00:02:28.343 --> 00:02:29.744
downed balloon.

00:02:29.878 --> 00:02:34.749
Carlos, what is the latest from

00:02:34.883 --> 00:02:38.353
there?

00:02:38.419 --> 00:02:40.655
&gt;&gt; Kate, so we are about 21

00:02:40.788 --> 00:02:42.857
miles off of the main debris

00:02:42.991 --> 00:02:44.559
zone off of the coast of south

00:02:44.692 --> 00:02:45.426
Carolina, and it is quite clear

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.363
that the FBI and the Navy are

00:02:48.363 --> 00:02:50.932
starting to make preparations to

00:02:51.065 --> 00:02:53.067
bring the debris here.

00:02:53.201 --> 00:02:54.836
It is a boat ramp and parking

00:02:54.969 --> 00:02:56.371
lot to the north of where the

00:02:56.404 --> 00:02:57.939
search is taking place and where

00:02:58.373 --> 00:02:59.607
for the past three days the Navy

00:02:59.741 --> 00:03:01.309
has prepositioned a lot of the

00:03:01.442 --> 00:03:03.912
equipment, and a lot of the

00:03:04.045 --> 00:03:04.379
personnel.

00:03:04.479 --> 00:03:06.714
It is where we saw a number of

00:03:06.848 --> 00:03:08.383
boats being brought in this

00:03:08.483 --> 00:03:10.385
morning and heavy equipment and

00:03:10.385 --> 00:03:12.587
oxygen tanks.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.389
An FBI agent told us earlier

00:03:14.389 --> 00:03:16.024
that they were securing the

00:03:16.391 --> 00:03:17.458
event in the event that they

00:03:17.592 --> 00:03:18.693
might have to bring some of the

00:03:18.826 --> 00:03:21.062
debris out here, and in the last

00:03:21.195 --> 00:03:23.631
few minutes, we saw flood lights

00:03:23.765 --> 00:03:26.801
and a forklift and storage

00:03:26.935 --> 00:03:27.335
containers.

00:03:27.468 --> 00:03:29.237
In the main debris site off of

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.538
the coast of South Carolina

00:03:30.672 --> 00:03:32.407
which is a half hour's drive

00:03:32.473 --> 00:03:34.042
here, the crews have been using

00:03:34.409 --> 00:03:36.077
the equipment to essentially

00:03:36.411 --> 00:03:36.778
scan the bottom of the ocean

00:03:36.911 --> 00:03:38.646
there to get a sense of how much

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.715
of this debris is still left

00:03:40.848 --> 00:03:41.282
there.

00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:44.419
Once they get that done, then

00:03:44.552 --> 00:03:45.553
they will start the work of

00:03:45.687 --> 00:03:50.491
lifting the debris out to ship,

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:51.593
and most likely bring it out

00:03:51.726 --> 00:03:53.027
here or to Virginia.

00:03:53.161 --> 00:03:54.429
&gt;&gt; Thank you, Carlos.

00:03:54.529 --> 00:03:57.732
And joining us is James clapper,

00:03:57.865 --> 00:04:00.635
the former director of national

00:04:00.768 --> 00:04:01.936
intelligence under president

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:02.437
Obama.

00:04:02.437 --> 00:04:06.808
And now I want to put up these

00:04:06.941 --> 00:04:09.043
images of the U.S. Navy, and I

00:04:09.177 --> 00:04:10.545
believe they are fascinating of

00:04:10.678 --> 00:04:12.580
what is being pulled in, and a

00:04:12.714 --> 00:04:13.681
much closer look at what they

00:04:13.815 --> 00:04:15.483
are recovering from the Chinese

00:04:15.617 --> 00:04:17.151
spy balloon, and we will put

00:04:17.285 --> 00:04:19.053
them up when we get them, but

00:04:19.187 --> 00:04:33.668
what are you seeing here?

00:04:33.801 --> 00:04:37.572
&gt;&gt; It looks to me as part of the

00:04:37.705 --> 00:04:40.642
larger deringer and the suite

00:04:40.775 --> 00:04:42.677
carried by the balloon, itself,

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.545
and this is a good sign, because

00:04:44.679 --> 00:04:46.681
it would indicate hopefully

00:04:46.814 --> 00:04:49.851
where this was going on, it is

00:04:49.984 --> 00:04:51.185
in relatively close proximity to

00:04:51.319 --> 00:04:53.154
the payload which is the key

00:04:53.287 --> 00:04:55.890
thing that you want to get here

00:04:56.024 --> 00:04:57.291
to analyze just what was the

00:04:57.425 --> 00:04:59.127
center suite, and what were the

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.829
Chinese actually trying to do,

00:05:01.963 --> 00:05:04.766
and what were they are trying to

00:05:04.899 --> 00:05:06.701
collect with this balloon.

00:05:06.834 --> 00:05:13.941
&gt;&gt; Absolutely right.

00:05:14.075 --> 00:05:15.710
And to another big question that

00:05:15.843 --> 00:05:17.745
is being reported by Oren

00:05:17.879 --> 00:05:19.280
Liebermann, and the previous

00:05:19.414 --> 00:05:21.115
incursions and what the U.S.

00:05:21.249 --> 00:05:22.717
Commander is saying about the

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.186
previous incursions by Chinese

00:05:25.319 --> 00:05:27.321
balloons is that they went

00:05:27.455 --> 00:05:29.624
undetected and what he said is a

00:05:29.757 --> 00:05:30.525
domain awareness gap.

00:05:30.525 --> 00:05:39.167
What does that mean to you?

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.036
&gt;&gt; Well, that is a military

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.840
jargon for we missed it.

00:05:45.973 --> 00:05:49.410
There is gray nether world for

00:05:49.544 --> 00:05:52.180
which the conventional military

00:05:52.547 --> 00:05:54.549
craft fly 40,000 feet and below

00:05:54.649 --> 00:05:56.851
and then we have good coverage.

00:05:56.984 --> 00:06:01.689
We can detect aircraft and other

00:06:01.823 --> 00:06:02.724
vehicles in that regime 40,000

00:06:02.857 --> 00:06:08.196
feet and below.

00:06:08.563 --> 00:06:10.965
With respect to spacecraft, we

00:06:11.099 --> 00:06:12.567
do a great job of tracking them,

00:06:12.633 --> 00:06:14.068
and there not a color, but there

00:06:14.202 --> 00:06:16.704
is an area where we don't

00:06:16.838 --> 00:06:19.841
apparently have a good technical

00:06:19.974 --> 00:06:21.576
capability of tracking objects

00:06:21.709 --> 00:06:23.277
in that zone of altitude if you

00:06:23.411 --> 00:06:25.680
will, and so that is what is

00:06:25.813 --> 00:06:26.581
afoot here.

00:06:26.581 --> 00:06:28.216
I am sure that we can bring to

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:31.319
bear the resources to overtime

00:06:31.452 --> 00:06:33.354
correct this deficiency, this

00:06:33.488 --> 00:06:38.726
domain awareness gap to use the

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:44.132
phrase.

00:06:44.265 --> 00:06:46.701
&gt;&gt; Yeah, I will try to work that

00:06:46.834 --> 00:06:47.602
into conversation more.

00:06:47.735 --> 00:06:49.871
And so, you said that the

00:06:50.004 --> 00:06:51.672
balloon had gone off course, and

00:06:51.806 --> 00:06:53.341
can you tell me more about that,

00:06:53.474 --> 00:06:54.976
and when you say that, do you

00:06:55.109 --> 00:06:57.712
believe it is not a spy balloon?

00:06:57.845 --> 00:06:58.746
&gt;&gt; No, no.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.815
I did not mean to imply that at

00:07:00.948 --> 00:07:01.682
all, Kate.

00:07:01.816 --> 00:07:03.484
What I meant is that I believe

00:07:03.618 --> 00:07:05.753
that the Chinese may have been

00:07:05.887 --> 00:07:07.155
truthful of it wandering off

00:07:07.288 --> 00:07:08.689
course, but I don't think they

00:07:08.823 --> 00:07:10.258
have been truthful of the center

00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:11.025
suite on it.

00:07:11.159 --> 00:07:13.427
I think that it is clearly for

00:07:13.561 --> 00:07:17.098
intelligence collection

00:07:17.231 --> 00:07:20.735
purposes.

00:07:20.868 --> 00:07:22.970
I have had some experience of my

00:07:23.104 --> 00:07:26.641
time with the intelligence

00:07:26.641 --> 00:07:29.177
communities with intelligence

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.645
collection balloons, and you are

00:07:30.711 --> 00:07:33.214
subject to the vagaries of

00:07:33.347 --> 00:07:34.649
weather, the fog, mist and rain

00:07:34.649 --> 00:07:39.287
and in this case most critically

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:39.720
wind.

00:07:39.854 --> 00:07:41.589
That is by the way, one of the

00:07:41.722 --> 00:07:42.824
interesting things that we can

00:07:42.957 --> 00:07:44.692
learn is just how much control

